    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi all,<br><br>I&#39;m getting NA&#39;s when running LOO -- I haven&#39;t had this problem for other very similar models on the same data. I don&#39;t see any obvious differences between the likelihood matrices that worked and the one that didn&#39;t work (no zeros or NaNs). Any common causes I should check for? Unfortunately they&#39;re too large to attach (4,000 x 18,600).<br><br>Thanks as always.<br><br>Best,<br>Tor</div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
